CROA — Licensing
=================

This repository uses two licenses, by content type:

1. SPECIFICATION AND DOCUMENTATION  (all prose: the spec/, docs/, public-review/,
   rfcs/, evidence/ text, and all .md files except where a subdirectory states
   otherwise) are licensed under the

       Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0)
       https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
       (full text: see LICENSE-DOCS)

2. CODE AND MACHINE-READABLE ARTIFACTS  (configuration, CI workflows, and any
   tooling in this repository; the reference harness and JSON schemas live in
   their own locations under the same terms) are licensed under the

       Apache License, Version 2.0
       https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
       (full text: see LICENSE-CODE)

You may use, implement, redistribute, and cite CROA under these terms without
fee. Implementing CROA requires no license, fee, or commercial program from any
party.

When in doubt about a specific file, the license stated in the nearest README
governs; absent that, prose is CC BY 4.0 and code is Apache-2.0.

Copyright (c) 2026 The CROA Project and contributors.

